{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"89407","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/89407","key":"MC-266968","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"24/Nov/23 12:11 AM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<h3><a name=\"Thebug\"></a>The bug</h3>\n\n<p>When <tt>/return</tt> is executed within an advancement reward function, it will discard all subsequent commands globally, not just the local commands that the function has.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Howtoreproduce\"></a>How to reproduce</h3>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>Install the data pack in Attachments</li>\n\t<li>Run \n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">/function mc-266968:a</pre>\n</div></div></li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<h4><a name=\"Results\"></a>Results</h4>\n\n<p>The following table shows whether each message was expected to be printed or not, and whether it was actually printed or not.</p>\n\n<div class=\"table-wrap\">\n<table class=\"confluenceTable\"><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"confluenceTh\">Message</th>\n<th class=\"confluenceTh\">Expected</th>\n<th class=\"confluenceTh\">Actual</th>\n<th class=\"confluenceTh\">&nbsp;</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"confluenceTd\">a-1</td>\n<td class=\"confluenceTd\">Yes</td>\n<td class=\"confluenceTd\">Yes</td>\n<td class=\"confluenceTd\"><img class=\"emoticon\" src=\"/images/icons/emoticons/check.png\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"confluenceTd\">a-2</td>\n<td class=\"confluenceTd\">Yes</td>\n<td class=\"confluenceTd\"><b>No</b></td>\n<td class=\"confluenceTd\"><img class=\"emoticon\" src=\"/images/icons/emoticons/error.png\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"confluenceTd\">b-1</td>\n<td class=\"confluenceTd\">Yes</td>\n<td class=\"confluenceTd\">Yes</td>\n<td class=\"confluenceTd\"><img class=\"emoticon\" src=\"/images/icons/emoticons/check.png\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"confluenceTd\">b-2</td>\n<td class=\"confluenceTd\">No</td>\n<td class=\"confluenceTd\">No</td>\n<td class=\"confluenceTd\"><img class=\"emoticon\" src=\"/images/icons/emoticons/check.png\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n\n\n<p>As the table suggests, <tt>say a-2</tt> in <tt>mc-266968:a</tt> was not executed because it was discarded by <tt>return 0</tt> in <tt>mc-266968:b</tt>.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Resources\"></a>Resources</h3>\n\n<div class=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;\"><b>data/mc-266968/functions/a.mcfunction</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">say a-1\nadvancement grant @s only mc-266968:b\nsay a-2\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;\"><b>data/mc-266968/functions/b.mcfunction</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">advancement revoke @s only mc-266968:b\nsay b-1\n<span class=\"code-keyword\">return</span> 0\nsay b-2\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;\"><b>data/mc-266968/advancements/b.json</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-json\">{\n  <span class=\"code-quote\">\"criteria\"</span>: {\n    \"\": {\n      <span class=\"code-quote\">\"trigger\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"impossible\"</span>\n    }\n  },\n  <span class=\"code-quote\">\"rewards\"</span>: {\n    <span class=\"code-quote\">\"<span class=\"code-keyword\">function</span>\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"mc-266968:b\"</span>\n  }\n}\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n</div></div>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Codeanalysis\"></a>Code analysis</h3>\n\n<p>An advancement reward function is executed as an initial function, which has a frame with depth 0, regardless of the current depth. Because <tt>/return</tt> discards all command queue entries above the depth of the currently executed function, <tt>/return</tt> executed in an advancement reward function discards all entries, which have a depth &gt;= 0.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"24/Nov/23 4:32 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/116453","id":"116453","filename":"mc-266968.zip","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png"},"displayName":"intsuc","active":true,"timeZone":"Asia/Tokyo","accountType":"customer"},"created":"24/Nov/23 12:13 AM","size":"2 kB","mimeType":"application/zip","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/116453"}],"versions":null,"resolutiondate":"28/Nov/23 5:09 AM","issuelinks":null,"updated":"20/Aug/26 4:32 AM","status":null},"fields":{"summary":"/return executed within an advancement reward function 